    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stitch. Expand. Optimize.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the architect of an ever-growing amalgamation of flesh and metal. This unique blend of <strong>resource management</strong> and <strong>puzzle-building</strong> challenges you to construct increasingly complex structures by seamlessly combining <strong>steampunk machinery</strong> with <strong>organic matter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully balance your resources\u2014<strong>blood and steam</strong>\u2014as you strategically place parts, ensuring a continuous flow to sustain and expand your grotesque creation. Will you craft a harmonious fusion, or will your construct collapse under the weight of your ambition?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stitch. Expand. Optimize.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the architect of an ever-growing amalgamation of flesh and metal. This unique blend of <strong>resource management</strong> and <strong>puzzle-building</strong> challenges you to construct increasingly complex structures by seamlessly combining <strong>steampunk machinery</strong> with <strong>organic matter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully balance your resources\u2014<strong>blood and steam</strong>\u2014as you strategically place parts, ensuring a continuous flow to sustain and expand your grotesque creation. Will you craft a harmonious fusion, or will your construct collapse under the weight of your ambition?</p>",
